# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   — imperative mood, <= 72 chars, no trailing period
#
# Explain what changed and why (wrap at 72). Leave a blank line above this body.
#
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: <description>  |  Refs: #<issue>
#
# Conventional Commit types:
#   feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
#
# Suggested scopes:
#   api     -> apps/api (Rust / axum service)
#   web     -> apps/web (Next.js console)
#   ci      -> workflows, actions, CI configuration
#   docs    -> documentation and blueprints
#   infra   -> Docker, compose, local stack
#
# Never add a `Co-Authored-By` trailer. Never commit secrets, .env files, or
# build artifacts (target/, node_modules/, dist/, .next/).
